{"id":"chatcmpl-221","object":"chat.completion","created":1777316369,"model":"qwen3.5:latest","system_fingerprint":"fp_ollama","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# =============================================================================\n# 脚本名称: process_cs_files.sh\n# 功能描述: 处理当前目录及子目录下的所有 .cs 文件\n# 作者: [您的名字]\n# 创建日期: 2024-01-01\n# =============================================================================\n\n# 启用严格模式：遇到错误立即停止，管道失败时中断\nset -euo pipefail\n\n# 设置颜色输出（增强可读性）\nRED='\\033[0;31m'\nGREEN='\\033[0;32m'\nYELLOW='\\033[1;33m'\nBLUE='\\033[0;34m'\nNC='\\033[0m' # 无颜色\n\n# 显示脚本使用信息\nusage() {\n    echo -e \"${BLUE}用法:${NC} $0 [选项]\"\n    echo -e \"${BLUE}选项:${NC}\"\n    echo \"  -l, --list          列出所有 .cs 文件\"\n    echo \"  -c, --count         统计 .cs 文件数量\"\n    echo \"  -s, --size          显示 .cs 文件总大小\"\n    echo \"  -o, --oldest        显示最旧的 .cs 文件\"\n    echo \"  -n, --newest        显示最新的 .cs 文件\"\n    echo \"  -p, --patterns      显示匹配特定模式的 .cs 文件\"\n    echo \"  -h, --help          显示帮助信息\"\n    echo \"\"\n    echo -e \"${YELLOW}示例:${NC}\"\n    echo \"  $0 -l                    # 列出所有 .cs 文件\"\n    echo \"  $0 -c                    # 统计 .cs 文件数量\"\n    echo \"  $0 -s                    # 显示 .cs 文件总大小\"\n    echo \"  $0 -p 'public class'     # 查找包含 'public class' 的文件\"\n    exit 0\n}\n\n# 检查是否提供了参数\nif [[ $# -eq 0 ]]; then\n    echo -e \"${GREEN}正在处理当前目录下的 .cs 文件...${NC}\"\n    echo \"\"\nfi\n\n# 查找所有 .cs 文件\ncs_files=()\nwhile IFS= read -r -d '' file; do\n    cs_files+=(\"$file\")\ndone \u003c \u003c(find . -type f -name \"*.cs\" -print0 2\u003e/dev/null)\n\n# 如果没有找到 .cs 文件\nif [[ ${#cs_files[@]} -eq 0 ]]; then\n    echo -e \"${RED}未找到任何 .cs 文件${NC}\"\n    exit 1\nfi\n\n# 显示所有 .cs 文件\nlist_files() {\n    echo -e \"${GREEN}找到以下 .cs 文件:${NC}\"\n    printf '%s\\n' \"${cs_files[@]}\"\n}\n\n# 统计 .cs 文件数量\ncount_files() {\n    echo -e \"${GREEN}找到 ${#cs_files[@]} 个 .cs 文件${NC}\"\n}\n\n# 显示 .cs 文件总大小\nsize_files() {\n    local total_size=0\n    for file in \"${cs_files[@]}\"; do\n        local size=$(stat -c%s \"$file\" 2\u003e/dev/null || echo 0)\n        total_size=$((total_size + size))\n    done\n    echo -e \"${GREEN}总大小: ${total_size} 字节${NC}\"\n}\n\n# 显示最旧的 .cs 文件\noldest_file() {\n    local oldest=\"${cs_files[0]}\"\n    local oldest_time=$(stat -c%Y \"$oldest\")\n    for file in \"${cs_files[@]}\"; do\n        local time=$(stat -c%Y \"$file\")\n        if [[ $time -lt $oldest_time ]]; then\n            oldest=\"$file\"\n            oldest_time=$time\n        fi\n    done\n    echo -e \"${YELLOW}最旧的 .cs 文件: $oldest${NC}\"\n}\n\n# 显示最新的 .cs 文件\nnewest_file() {\n    local newest=\"${cs_files[0]}\"\n    local newest_time=$(stat -c%Y \"$newest\")\n    for file in \"${cs_files[@]}\"; do\n        local time=$(stat -c%Y \"$file\")\n        if [[ $time -gt $newest_time ]]; then\n            newest=\"$file\"\n            newest_time=$time\n        fi\n    done\n    echo -e \"${YELLOW}最新的 .cs 文件: $newest${NC}\"\n}\n\n# 显示匹配特定模式的 .cs 文件\npatterns_files() {\n    local pattern=\"$1\"\n    echo -e \"${GREEN}匹配模式 '$pattern' 的 .cs 文件:${NC}\"\n    for file in \"${cs_files[@]}\"; do\n        if grep -q \"$pattern\" \"$file\" 2\u003e/dev/null; then\n            echo \"  $file\"\n        fi\n    done\n}\n\n# 解析命令行参数\ncase \"${1:-}\" in\n    -l|--list)\n        list_files\n        ;;\n    -c|--count)\n        count_files\n        ;;\n    -s|--size)\n        size_files\n        ;;\n    -o|--oldest)\n        oldest_file\n        ;;\n    -n|--newest)\n        newest_file\n        ;;\n    -p|--patterns)\n        if [[ -n \"$2\" ]]; then\n            patterns_files \"$2\"\n        else\n            echo -e \"${RED}请提供搜索模式${NC}\"\n            exit 1\n        fi\n        ;;\n    -h|--help)\n        usage\n        ;;\n    *)\n        echo -e \"${RED}未知选项: $1${NC}\"\n        usage\n        ;;\nesac\n\n# 默认操作：列出所有文件\nlist_files\n```\n\n### 使用说明：\n\n1. **保存脚本**：将上述内容保存为 `process_cs_files.sh`\n2. **添加执行权限**：\n   ```bash\n   chmod +x process_cs_files.sh\n   ```\n3. **运行脚本**：\n   ```bash\n   ./process_cs_files.sh -l    # 列出所有 .cs 文件\n   ./process_cs_files.sh -c    # 统计文件数量\n   ./process_cs_files.sh -s    # 显示总大小\n   ./process_cs_files.sh -p \"public class\"  # 搜索特定模式\n   ```\n\n### 功能特性：\n\n- ✅ 严格错误处理（`set -euo pipefail`）\n- ✅ 彩色终端输出\n- ✅ 支持多种操作选项\n- ✅ 支持模式搜索\n- ✅ 良好的注释和文档\n\n您可以根据需要修改脚本逻辑或添加更多功能！","reasoning":"The user is asking me to create a bash script that processes all .cs files (C# files). They want me to:\n\n1. Add a shebang (#!/bin/bash)\n2. Set strict mode (set -euo pipefail)\n3. Add comments explaining what the script does\n4. Make it functional\n\nLet me create a comprehensive bash script that can process .cs files. Common operations for .cs files might include:\n- Listing them\n- Counting lines\n- Finding files\n- Checking for specific patterns\n- etc.\n\nLet me write a useful script that demonstrates these capabilities."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":88,"completion_tokens":1633,"total_tokens":1721}}
